{"4792380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dread Line: Metro", "steam_appid": 4792380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay hidden and find valuable items to earn your passage through post apocalyptic rooms and tunnels of the Dread Line. Be quick, stay hidden, and most important of all...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...don't make a single sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooms can be dark, and filled with worthless junk. Keep your eyes peeled for shinny valuable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792380/extras/33c7aa4ae2f67a0ca4e08eb3b99f183f.poster.avif?t=1787760446\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792380/extras/33c7aa4ae2f67a0ca4e08eb3b99f183f.webm?t=1787760446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792380/extras/33c7aa4ae2f67a0ca4e08eb3b99f183f.mp4?t=1787760446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay quiet! Every sound you make attracts them to you!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792380/extras/1f22012a5192af9836bac3cb4f362ffc.poster.avif?t=1787760446\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792380/extras/1f22012a5192af9836bac3cb4f362ffc.webm?t=1787760446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4792380/extras/1f22012a5192af9836bac3cb4f362ffc.mp4?t=1787760446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragra